{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">After more than an hour, we finally reached the cram school </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> goes to.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We usually get around by bike, so it had been a long time since I'd walked this much.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I agreed with </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s verdict, too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s cram school... when does it let out...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hmm... 
{PAUSE ""}
I've got no clue which classes she's even in..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Maybe we try barging in?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's a pretty bold suggestion... 
{PAUSE ""}
But if somebody we know is in there, that'd be bad. 
{PAUSE ""}
No phone either, so I guess all we can do is wait..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">That meant waiting here to ambush </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We didn't know when it would end, and after walking for over an hour, we were wiped out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was there anywhere we could rest properly while keeping a constant eye on the cram school entrance...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店外観.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Right across from the cram school, there was a cafe.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From a window seat here, we could rest properly while lying in wait, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Let's kill time here. Nobody we know's gonna be in a place like this anyway."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In location and in atmosphere alike, it was everything we could ask for, but...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The storefront looked a bit pricey...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, this one's on me!
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE>Ah... I don't have my wallet..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You treated me to pizza at lunch, so I'll pay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ugh... sorry..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sei_ge_cowbell01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Welcome!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We were greeted with a ringing voice on a clearly different level from Zahha's, and a greeting with an air of class.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We sat at the seat with the best view of the cram school entrance.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you very much for visiting us today. Here is our regular menu. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Today's recommendations are on the blackboard, so please take a look at those as well."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Y-Yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thanks..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A voice and diction that were clear and pleasant to hear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The waitress set down the menus and, leaving a nice scent behind, walked away with a light step.</STYLE><PG>
"Seriously gorgeous... What the heck..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What a figure... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">There was someone like that in Motoki-cho..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Her hair's brown and all, but she's not tacky at all... 
{PAUSE ""}
How do I put it, she's got this real glamour, like, an aura."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Looks like we've come somewhere pretty amazing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At the other tables, refined madams were enjoying an elegant afternoon teatime.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Have you seen the apartment building in front of Motoki Station?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ohohoho! Oh, do stop, Madam! The apartment building in front of Motoki Station is already five years old! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Right now, there is a fine plot of land near Central Park with a lovely view of the cherry blossoms!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, Madam, really! Buying land in a neighborhood where such an incident happened this very morning! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Besides, what I meant was the showroom for the apartment building due to be completed next year!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh my! Having come all the way to Motoki-cho with its beautiful cherry blossoms, an apartment would be such a waste! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　In Motoki-cho, it simply must be a house of one's own!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, no! What I want is an apartment for my husband's study! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　For that, a quiet apartment building is far preferable!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, how lovely! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But really, having come to Motoki-cho, one wants a place where the goshinboku is always in view! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Oh! Buying the land near Central Park might be nice as well!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It sounded like nothing but bragging about how rich they were.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Despite their refined looks, what they were saying was pretty unrefined...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Those two are Motoki new money..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Motoki new money?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Rich people've got their eye on Motoki-cho's cherry blossoms and nature, and they're buying up real estate, I heard. 
{PAUSE ""}
Thanks to that, apartment buildings are popping up all over. 
{PAUSE ""}
Feels like Motoki-cho's losing what made it good..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well, it's a good thing for Motoki-cho to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にぎ">thriving</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Haah... 
{PAUSE ""}
But... somehow it just feels wrong..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it, lately Motoki-cho's population had been growing and growing, and so had the buildings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When I was a kid, there were lots of fields, and we used to play in them, but now even those fields lay under apartment buildings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's true, I don't really like that either...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It's a good thing that the cherry blossoms and the goshinboku draw people here, but from those 'refined' madams I learned all over again the all-too-common irony that this slowly </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="むしば">eats away at</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> the cherry blossoms and the nature.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I suppose this is what they call the grown-up world.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Anyway, we need to order something. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Just sitting here without ordering would be pretty bad..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Um... 
{PAUSE ""}
The cheapest one is... 
{PAUSE ""}
blend coffee at... 
{PAUSE ""}
1,200 yen!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Coffee for 1,200 yen? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Come now, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, surely you jest..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s menu I snatched away, and when I checked the price for myself―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Yep, I see. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">For a joke, that price isn't very funny..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At the very least, I confirmed there wasn't a single item at 1,000 yen or less.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There was still over 4,000 yen in my wallet, so we were fine, if you could call it fine, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For high schoolers like us, being told to find 1,000 yen worth of value in a coffee was a pretty tall order.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Okay, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
we're making a run for it when they're not looking!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You're going to dine and dash!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Keep it down!
{PAUSE ""}
　Besides, we haven't even ordered anything yet!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">look..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I pointed at the corner of the menu and confronted </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> with a further dose of reality.</STYLE><PG>
"As a cover charge... 
{PAUSE ""}
300 yen per person...?
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
　What the heck is this mystery system called a cover charge!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Do. Not. Know."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Why're you talking in broken speech!?
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>! Look up this cover charge system thing on your phone!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I. No. Phone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Argh!
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE>There might be even more mystery systems...!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Okay, once we meet up with <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, we're making <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE> pay!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You're going to mooch off </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">my cute junior</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Besides, you're planning to have her put us up tonight, aren't you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>... do you know how much I've treated <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> to up till now?
{PAUSE ""}
　I could order three of these Sweets Deluxe Sets and still get change back..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, you've had it rough too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's gotta be 'cause <STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE> raised her wrong back in middle school..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I. Do. Not. Know."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Today <STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE>'re such a pain..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you ready to order?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The waitress from before suddenly appeared.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"U-Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Two blend coffees, please!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Certainly. I shall prepare them right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My mind went blank, and I ordered the cheapest thing on impulse.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I've got it!
{PAUSE ""}
　A cover charge is a system where a pretty lady like that serves you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Somehow that's a kinda shady way to put it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Which means...!
{PAUSE ""}
