{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Rip. Off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I can't even tell if that's broken speech anymore!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
