<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
Hey, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
Two coffees coming, I understand, and I think that's only natural. 
{PAUSE ""}
But why is there a cookie―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Do. Not. Know."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm still in the middle of talking!
{PAUSE ""}
　Why...
{PAUSE ""}
did a cookie come with it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hurriedly checked the menu again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Phew, it says the cookie comes as a free service when you order coffee. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But... </STYLE>
