{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Do. Not. Know."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Today, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, you're a pain..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE>'re one to talk!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Anyway, since we had the coffee, I decided to try drinking it.</STYLE><PG>
